# Phase 20.5 M2 fix — exclude large irrelevant dirs from build context.
# Keeps Dockerfile.dev rebuild fast even when these paths change. The
# split-COPY pattern in Dockerfile.dev pairs with this file: go.mod/go.sum
# go in via the first COPY layer; the bulk COPY . . relies on this list to
# stay cache-friendly.

.git/
.github/
docs/
examples/
stacks/
*.md
!README.md

# Build artifacts
tmp/
coverage.out
*.test

# Local dev env
.envrc
bin/
